{"version":1,"content":"<p>科技界「億萬教父」黃仁勳驚爆婚外情成為全城熱話，有網民發現他曾經受訪時表示「成龍很像我」，巧合地兩人都因外遇事件鬧得滿城風雨，即被網友笑稱神預言。</p><p>黃仁勳於2023年亮相網上節目《The Moment with Ryan Patel》，當時節</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:23:18.160066+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T12:01:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:08.969385+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:08.969385+00:00","content_hash":"48561b9f5d06a0a8617df20de0f11c9767be6bca948ab293790edaa2f5e82519","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}